  "contract": [
    "Eye of Kimbul 503714 marks a critically struck enemy with 802707: 'While affected, enemies cannot stealth",
    "or turn invisible.' 802707 has only auras 271 and 308, and no code stopped a marked unit from stealthing:",
    "both final05 runs kept the stealth and invisibility auras on the marked dummy (cycle 8 R3 (b)). The fix",
    "refuses a stealth or invisibility spell while the caster carries 802707 and strips both when the mark",
    "lands. The enemy is a player, so a refused cast is a cast result and not a harness error. A forced spell",
    "crit rating makes a real Hexfire 573026 critical in both arms; the arms differ only in the Eye talent.",
    "Expected: unmarked, the enemy enters Stealth Dummy 2144558 (aura 16) and Head of the Horseman Invisible",
    "44312 (aura 18); marked, both casts fail with SPELL_FAILED_CASTER_AURASTATE (22) and no aura lands."
  ],
